{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/2114587088ac21cba1211f111260b20f.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Romance by Day, Werewolf by Night?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 3114 of the Starcrown Era, artificial womb technology has been legalized within the Galactic Union.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to an unexpected malfunction on the Galactic public railway, you are forced to land on Ferron\u2014a planet riddled with black markets and illegal industries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you are free to explore Ferron: gather clues, build relationships, take part-time jobs, and uncover fragments of truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By night, escalating crises emerge, and you must face the dangers hidden beneath the planet\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive until the day you finally leave?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when all the clues are pieced together, the truth of Ferron may be far more unsettling than you imagined\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/974b26a223545c07e64ebdf9fadb8e61.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Night Council:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, the \u201cNight Council\u201d convenes. Use what you uncovered during the day to choose the right side among rival factions\u2014your decision will directly determine others\u2019 fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/b50a727d62e248ed9532ffda787f0fdc.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light Puzzles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text-based logic deduction that won\u2019t hard-lock your progress, but still rewards careful thinking to catch key clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/25f7e0c4fc4042ae0e6c565311596c0d.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Relationships</strong> (Non-Traditional Romance):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the planet Felron during the day, following character paths to uncover the world and their personal stories, focusing on an ensemble cast. (5 romanceable characters; building a strong bond unlocks a happy ending CG.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/fa30a5ee08afc5851fc6fbc205c7c02c.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Map Exploration:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is governed by action points\u2014during the day, you are free to explore, but careful planning is required. At the start, a psychological test generates unique attribute values for each player. Some clues and events require attribute checks. Players must make trade-offs when advancing relationships, searching for clues, and improving stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/fcc8f222d0da5f654aed98d2d7c21876.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1080 height=2102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/69847c6ae97c208841ac50f7a5afbd25.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1080 height=2738 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and plenty of other characters you\u2019ll meet on Ferron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/45572127b40c204472e8a59a7a4cec0b.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/extras/4fc84aabbfa4694e9828981774c9dd11.avif?t=1771954708\" width=1200 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Right now, the game is made by 1 full-time and 1 part-time developer\u2014no outsourcing, entirely hand-made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With no fans yet, every wishlist really counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We hope this is just the start of our adventure together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2605<strong>Since our team is tiny, we\u2019ll decide which languages to add based on wishlist support from different regions.</strong>\u2605</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you like the game, please show your support by adding it to your wishlist\u2014thank you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902140?t=1771954708","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/6b9a3c6f511509d7d5f26297d0ce7d7c1c0e9fa6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771954708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902140/eafc97214cf592fa7d0f9d5c58c1c0fae50716a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771954708","capsule_